# Clang-Tidy configuration for benchmarks
#
# All checks disabled (issue #590). Measured 2026-08-20: clang-tidy's wall time
# per TU is ~100% check-execution cost over the AST `import storm;` pulls in
# (parsing itself is ~0s — `--checks='-*'` is instant). benchmarks/** is not
# analyzed by SonarCloud either, so this trades away that coverage for
# commit-time speed.
Checks: '-*'
